    "interval": "All options/arguments and the bound actual public Root method are prepared before timing. Immediately before invoking that bound Root.write/create/copyIn method until its promise settles, including library admission/stage/publication/fences/settlement. Caller validation, fixture reset, Root construction and report writes stay outside. No adapter option spreading/dispatch or component subtraction.",
