    "pathReason": "Literal dot+platform separator prefix naturally disables route acceleration without native mocks. POSIX complete/missing eligible/deopt all timed. Windows complete-parent branch runs before session creation, hence only one complete route per API; both missing routes timed.",
    "fixtures": "Private task workspace; fixed depth8. Complete parent chain exists untimed. Missing timing layout starts with firstcomponent present and remaining7 absent before every call. Qualifier separately covers partial(first4) and all-missing(first0). Existing unrelated denied directory stays empty with exact identity. Write/copy complete rows start with existing sentinel leaf; creates have absent leaf. Exact contents/names/identity checked before owned unlink/rmdir; copy source unchanged. No recursive cleanup hides extras.",
    "retention": "Atomic cumulative raw-sample report after every completed sample outside interval. Incomplete/failure status survives interruption. All accepted samples retained, no trimming/retries/selective pooling.",
    "statistics": {
      "leg": "median of five arithmetic sample means",
      "quartet": "geometric mean twoB leg medians / geometric mean twoA",
      "paired": "geometric mean eight quartet ratios",
      "orders": "separate geometric means of fourABBA and fourBAAB quartets",
      "bootstrap": "100000 whole-quartet resamples of8 draws; xorshift32 seed734 shifts13/17/5, uint32 eachupdate, index=floor(uint32/2^32*8), reset stream eachcell; upper95 nearest-rank ceil(.95*N)-1"
